<title>SWEDEN: Stadshypotek to be de-listed on June 30.</title>
<headline>Stadshypotek to be de-listed on June 30.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Handelsbanken said on Monday in a statement the last day of trade in Stadshypotek A-series shares would be June 30.</p>
<p>Handelsbanken acquired mortgage lender Stadshypotek in February for 22.9 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
